ONCILED_VERDICT_SCHEMA` in contracts.py +\n  `JUDGE_DECISION_SCHEMA`; critic_a/critic_b(Anthropic-fallback)/reconciler/judge pass schemas;\n  Gemini path + langextract untouched. Off-schema judge â†’ abstain (fail-closed, enforced by\n  `_parse_response`, not by `strict`).\n- **Gate:** `python -m pytest` = 874 passed (869 after EXECUTE, +5 after FIX). No test weakening.\n- **Review:** 2 reviewers, both GO. R1 nothing found (fail-closed independently re-verified by the\n  parser). R2 GO-conditional with W5-F1 (MEDIUM): no-`required` strict schema acceptance is\n  unverified against the live API; a rejection would 400 on both Sonnet+Haiku and (since\n  critic/reconciler weren't exception-wrapped) abort the nightly sweep. FIX iter 1: structured call\n  now DEGRADES to a plain text call on any structured-call failure (metered once off the successful\n  call, degrade logged) + defense-in-depth (critic_a/b/reconciler treat a hard call error as\n  degrade-to-None). Closure VERIFIER mutation-tested all â†’ GO.\n- **TRIPWIRE:** if the live API rejects the no-`required` strict schema, structured outputs silently\n  degrade to the legacy plain-text parse (no benefit, no harm). A one-call live smoke against\n  Sonnet/Haiku would confirm whether the schema activates; until then, treat L3 as best-effort.\n\n### Wave 6 â€” L4: Adaptive thinking via `effort` â€” GREEN (2026-06-07)\n\n- **Deliverables:** `call_anthropic`/`call_model` gain `effort` (maps to `thinking={\"type\":\"adaptive\"}`\n  + `output_config={\"effort\": low|medium|high|xhigh|max}` per the claude-api skill); a recursive\n  `_assert_no_budget_tokens` guard runs before EVERY Anthropic dispatch (initial + Haiku fallback +\n  structuredâ†’plain degrade) â€” Opus 4.8 400s on budget_tokens; `_fold_thinking_into_output` folds any\n  separately-reported thinking tokens into metered output (the $118 lesson). Default (effort unset) =\n  cost-neutral, byte-for-byte unchanged. Gemini `thinking_budget=0` guard + `thoughts_toke